---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Services | One Take Wonder Marketing"
  description="Full-service marketing agency offering strategy, brand identity, media buying, digital advertising, SEO, PPC, social media, web design, video production, TV/OTT, PR, and more. Over 10 years of proven ROI."
>

<!-- Page Hero -->
<section class="bg-gray-900 py-20 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
    <p class="text-brand-pink-light font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-4">Our Services</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Everything Your Marketing Needs, <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-pink-light to-brand-pink bg-clip-text text-transparent">All Under One Roof</span></h1>
    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      From strategy to execution, creative to measurement — we offer every marketing service your business needs to grow, all managed by one dedicated team.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STRATEGY & PLANNING -->
<section id="strategy" class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">Strategy & Planning</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">The <span class="gradient-text">Foundation</span> of Great Marketing</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Every successful campaign starts with a clear strategy. We build the roadmap that turns your goals into results.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Marketing Strategy & Planning</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          We build the overall marketing roadmap designed to help your business grow with purpose and measurable results. Our strategic planning process aligns your goals, target audience, messaging, budget, and performance objectives into a clear action plan that drives success.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Brand Strategy & Identity</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          We help define who you are and how your business is perceived in the market. From brand positioning and messaging to visual identity and brand guidelines, we create brands that are memorable, differentiated, and built for long-term growth.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Market Research & Consumer Insights</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          We uncover the insights that matter most. Through audience research, competitor analysis, and market evaluation, we help you better understand your customers and make informed marketing decisions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MEDIA & ADVERTISING -->
<section id="media" class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">Media & Advertising</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">Placing Your Message <span class="gradient-text">Where It Performs</span></h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Strategic media planning and buying across every channel — traditional, digital, streaming, and everything in between.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Media Planning & Buying</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We strategically place your message where it will perform best. We evaluate channels, negotiate placements, and manage media investments across traditional and digital platforms to maximize impact and efficiency.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Digital Advertising</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We create and manage high-performing digital campaigns designed to increase visibility, generate leads, and drive conversions across search, display, streaming, and social platforms.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">TV / Broadcast / Cable / OTT / Streaming Advertising</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We help brands reach audiences across every screen through strategic television and streaming advertising solutions. From campaign strategy and creative production to media planning, broadcast and cable TV buying, OTT and Connected TV placement, and ongoing optimization, we deliver high-impact campaigns designed to increase awareness, drive engagement, and generate measurable results.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Radio & Audio Advertising</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We develop impactful audio campaigns that connect with listeners through compelling messaging, professional production, and strategic placement across terrestrial radio, satellite, streaming audio, and podcasts.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Pay-Per-Click (PPC) Advertising</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We develop and manage targeted paid search campaigns focused on generating qualified traffic, increasing conversions, and maximizing return on investment.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Social Media Management & Advertising</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We build social strategies that connect with your audience and strengthen your brand presence. From content creation and publishing to paid campaigns and community engagement, we manage every step.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- DIGITAL & WEB -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">Websites & Digital</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">Digital Experiences That <span class="gradient-text">Drive Growth</span></h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        From search visibility to website performance, we optimize every digital touchpoint to attract, engage, and convert.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Search Engine Optimization (SEO)</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We improve your online visibility so your customers can find you faster. Through technical optimization, content strategy, keyword targeting, and search best practices, we help increase organic traffic and long-term growth.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Website Design & Development</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We design and build websites that combine beautiful design with seamless functionality. Our websites are optimized for user experience, mobile performance, lead generation, and conversion.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO)</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We turn more visitors into customers by improving website performance, optimizing user journeys, and removing barriers to conversion.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Email Marketing & Automation</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We build automated email strategies that nurture relationships and keep your audience engaged. From campaigns and newsletters to customer journeys and CRM integration, we help streamline communication.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CREATIVE & CONTENT -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">Creative & Content</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">Ideas That <span class="gradient-text">Capture Attention</span></h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Compelling creative that brings your brand to life and content that educates, engages, and converts.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Creative Services</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We bring ideas to life through compelling creative execution. Our team develops campaign concepts, visual design, copywriting, and branded assets that capture attention and inspire action.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Content Marketing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We create meaningful content that educates, engages, and converts. Whether through blogs, articles, video, email campaigns, or educational resources, we help position your brand as an industry leader.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Video Production</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We bring your brand story to life through high-quality video production designed to engage audiences and drive results. From concept development and scriptwriting to filming, editing, and final delivery, we create compelling video content tailored for television commercials, streaming platforms, social media, websites, digital advertising, and promotional campaigns.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Jingle & Music Marketing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We produce custom jingles and sound identities that give your brand a unified audio presence alongside your visual identity — increasing brand recall across TV, radio, streaming, digital ads, and every touchpoint where your audience listens.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Production & Print Services</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We bring your brand into the physical world through professionally produced print materials including brochures, direct mail, signage, packaging, and promotional assets.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BRAND & AUDIENCE -->
<section id="brand" class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">Brand & Audience</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">Building <span class="gradient-text">Relationships</span> That Last</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Strengthening your brand reputation and connecting with your audience through strategic communication and experiences.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Public Relations (PR)</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We strengthen brand reputation through strategic communication, media outreach, press releases, and opportunities that increase visibility and credibility.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Influencer Marketing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We connect brands with creators who align with their audience and goals. We manage influencer partnerships, campaign execution, and performance measurement from start to finish.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Event Marketing & Experiential</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We create memorable brand experiences through events, activations, sponsorships, and customer engagement opportunities that leave lasting impressions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MEASUREMENT -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">Measurement</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">Data That <span class="gradient-text">Drives Decisions</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 border border-gray-200 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Analytics & Reporting</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          We believe every marketing decision should be measurable. We provide performance tracking, campaign reporting, dashboards, and insights that turn data into action — so you always know exactly what your marketing is delivering.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FLEXIBLE SOLUTIONS -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
    <p class="section-label">Flexible Solutions</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading mb-6">Built Around <span class="gradient-text">Your Goals</span></h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg mb-10">
      Whether you need a complete marketing partner or support for specific initiatives, we tailor our services to fit your business goals, budget, and growth stage.
    </p>
    <p class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
      Small business. Mid-size company. Established brand. <span class="gradient-text">We build marketing that works.</span>
    </p>
    <div class="mt-12">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary text-lg !px-10 !py-4">Start the Conversation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
